{"id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","title":"Vector Space","display":"df-vector-space — Vector Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-vector-space","aliases":["58-df-vector-space","Vector Space"],"display":"df-vector-space — Vector Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-field]]","[[58-df-abelian-group]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-vector-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-vector-space</span><span>Vector Space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-vector-space — Vector Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"58-df-abelian-group\">58-df-abelian-group</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,V,+_V,\\odot\\in V\">\\(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,V,+_V,\\odot\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(V,+_V)\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(V,+_V)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"58-df-abelian-group\">58-df-abelian-group</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\)</span> (fully explicit predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k(V,+_V,\\odot)\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k(V,+_V,\\odot)\\)</span> (compatibility predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}space\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(V,+_V)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_V,V\\times V,V)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot,k\\times V,V)\\land\\forall u,v\\in V\\;\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in k\\;\\Bigl(\\odot(\\langle\\alpha,+_V(\\langle u,v\\rangle)\\rangle)=+_V(\\langle\\odot(\\langle\\alpha,u\\rangle),\\odot(\\langle\\alpha,v\\rangle)\\rangle)\\land\\odot(\\langle+_k(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle),u\\rangle)=+_V(\\langle\\odot(\\langle\\alpha,u\\rangle),\\odot(\\langle\\beta,u\\rangle)\\rangle)\\land\\odot(\\langle\\cdot_k(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle),u\\rangle)=\\odot(\\langle\\alpha,\\odot(\\langle\\beta,u\\rangle)\\rangle)\\land\\odot(\\langle1_k,u\\rangle)=u\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}space\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(V,+_V)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_V,V\\times V,V)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot,k\\times V,V)\\land\\forall u,v\\in V\\;\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in k\\;\\Bigl(\\odot(\\langle\\alpha,+_V(\\langle u,v\\rangle)\\rangle)=+_V(\\langle\\odot(\\langle\\alpha,u\\rangle),\\odot(\\langle\\alpha,v\\rangle)\\rangle)\\land\\odot(\\langle+_k(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle),u\\rangle)=+_V(\\langle\\odot(\\langle\\alpha,u\\rangle),\\odot(\\langle\\beta,u\\rangle)\\rangle)\\land\\odot(\\langle\\cdot_k(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle),u\\rangle)=\\odot(\\langle\\alpha,\\odot(\\langle\\beta,u\\rangle)\\rangle)\\land\\odot(\\langle1_k,u\\rangle)=u\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}space}\\vdash\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k(V,+_V,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\\;\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}space}\\vdash\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k(V,+_V,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k\\in V\\;\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Vector space: set with addition and scalar multiplication</li>\n<li>Basis: linearly independent spanning set</li>\n<li>Dimension: well-defined for finite-dimensional spaces</li>\n<li>Examples: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span>, function spaces <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C([0,1])\">\\(C([0,1])\\)</span>, polynomial spaces</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Axler, Linear Algebra Done Right</li>\n<li>Roman, Advanced Linear Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-abelian-group","status":"resolved","id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-abelian-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)$ (see [[58-df-field]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-abelian-group","status":"resolved","id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(V,+_V)$ (see [[58-df-abelian-group]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,V,+_V,\\odot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianGroup}_S(V,+_V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k(V,+_V,\\odot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}space\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\\mathrm{